00:01:03.530 --> 00:01:06.900 size:53% position:73% line:53%
MARTIN FOURNIER, coréalisateur

00:01:04.731 --> 00:01:08.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- En fait, la grande question

00:01:05.966 --> 00:01:09.336 size:53% position:73% line:53%
de ce documentaic'est :

00:01:07.200 --> 00:01:10.570 size:53% position:73% line:53%
