00:01:29.222 --> 00:01:38.698 size:53% position:73% line:53%
il a une force. En fait, c'estqd

00:01:31.691 --> 00:01:39.933 size:53% position:73% line:53%
tu le rencontres vraiment.

00:01:37.797 --> 00:01:41.134 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Au-delà du drame humain,

00:01:38.999 --> 00:01:42.369 size:53% position:73% line:53%
