00:01:42.669 --> 00:01:46.072 size:53% position:73% line:53%
- Montrer la beauté et la bonté

00:01:43.903 --> 00:01:47.274 size:53% position:73% line:53%
des gens de coeur, c'est

00:01:45.138 --> 00:01:48.508 size:53% position:73% line:53%
